SUMMARY:5K Time Trial + Very Light Pull
DESCRIPTION:Overview:\nMacros: 3350 kcal\, 175 g protein\, 455 g carbs\, 9
 5 g fat\nMacro timing: 30-60 g carbs 60-120 min before running\, then 25-
 35 g protein plus carbs after.\nCategory: time_trial\nRun volume: 5 km\nA
 djustments:\n- Adjusted for recovery constraint.\n- Temporary 50% working
 -load cap.\n\nWarm-Up:\n- 5-10 min easy movement\, joint prep\, and 2-3 g
 radual ramp sets before loading.\n\nMain Work:\n- 5K time trial: full rac
 e effort after a progressive warm-up.\n- Very light supported pull: chest
 -supported row\, neutral-grip pulldown\, rear-delt work\, and easy curls\
 ; use no more than 50% of normal working load.\n- Skip unsupported rows\,
  loaded hinging\, back extensions\, explosive push-off work\, and trainin
 g to failure.\n- Stop if symptoms change normal movement\; reassess recov
 ery this evening and the next morning.\n\nRun:\n- Planned running volume:
  5 km.\n\nFueling:\n- Hit daily macros\, keep protein near target\, and p
 lace carbohydrates before and after training.\n\nRecovery:\n- easy cooldo
 wn\, carbohydrates\, protein\, fluids\, and an early night.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hubert-training-20260727@training-calendar
