 0 km\nAdjustments:\n- Protective changes from prior-month body-part feedb
 ack.\n- Reduced for prior-month recovery feedback.\n- Adjusted for tempor
 ary low-back recovery constraint.\n- Return-to-impact loading ramp.\n\nWa
 rm-Up:\n- 5-10 min easy movement\, joint prep\, and 2-3 gradual ramp sets
  before loading.\n\nMain Work:\n- Bike aerobic RPE 3-4: 25-40 min convers
 ational\; keep cadence smooth and pressure through the whole foot.\n- Foo
 t prep: foot-intrinsic activation\, short-foot / arch lifts\, isometric i
 nversion and eversion\, sole-to-sole isometrics\, and banded eversion or 
 inversion within 0-2/10 symptoms.\n\nOptional:\n- Optional walking stays 
 short and flat\; skip fast walking\, hills\, and long sloped surfaces.\n\
 nFueling:\n- keep carbs before and after so size gain remains the main tr
 aining priority.\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window stays 22:00-06:00\; add mob
 ility if joints feel stiff.
