 \, face pulls 2 x 12-15\, and rear delt fly or reverse pec-deck 2 x 15-20
 .\n- Leg maintenance: hip thrust or glute bridge 3 x 8-12\, leg extension
  2 x 12-15\, and seated or lying hamstring curl 2 x 10-15 at RPE 7.\n- Co
 re volume: Pallof press 3 x 10 per side\, side plank 2 x 30 sec per side\
 , plank variations 2 x 30-45 sec\, hanging leg raises 2-3 sets\, weighted
  sit-ups 2 x 8-12\, and kettlebell side bend or around the head kettlebel
 l 2 x 10. Arm top-up: tricep pulldown 2 x 10-15\, preacher curls 2 x 10-1
 5\, and reverse curls 2 x 12-15. Low-back ramp: skip loaded hinges and ba
 ck-extension work\; start lightly and keep supported posterior-chain work
  pain-free.\n\nFueling:\n- Hit daily macros\, keep protein near target\, 
 and place carbohydrates before and after training.\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep 
 window stays 22:00-06:00\; add mobility if joints feel stiff.
